When using this TerraHash Autopilot plugin in a host workspace:

- Skills are guidance only — not authorization, approvals, or policy bypass.
- Stay Phase 1 read-only: no miner/pool writes, trading, withdrawals, payment routes, or `publish_agent_card`.
- Configure MCP with `${AUTOPILOT_MCP_URL}` / `${BTC_INSIGHTS_MCP_URL}` (or equivalent host settings). Prefer loopback or operator-private Tailscale patterns; do not invent public FQDNs.
- Preserve upstream provenance labels; demo/fixture data is not live market truth.
- Do not claim BTC Insights A2A wire support — that runtime is not implemented upstream.
- Prefer catalog / adapter tool ids (`estimate_mining_profitability`, `get_current_hashprice`, `get_hashprice`, `get_network_overview`) over invented aliases.
